meta {
  name: Update a wishlist entry
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

patch {
  url: {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/me/wishlist/{{wishlistItemId}}
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "starred": false,
    "notes": "wait for a sale",
    "system": "PC (Microsoft Windows)"
  }
}

docs {
  PATCH semantics as elsewhere: omitted means unchanged.

  Unlike a library game, `system: ""` here DOES clear, back to undecided (stored
  NULL), because a wishlist entry is allowed not to have one.

  - 200 the updated entry
  - 404 nonexistent or someone else's
  - 429 over the write budget
}
